cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MAESTRO in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MAESTRO: Modular Ontology Stack for Future-Proof Manufacturing"
abstract: >
  MAESTRO is a modular, standards-aligned OWL/Turtle ontology stack for
  Industry 4.0 / Industry 5.0 manufacturing. It separates capability,
  skill, and execution semantics so that ROS, IEC 61131, IEC 61499 and
  OPC UA implementations can interoperate through a shared logical
  vocabulary.
